plasma-discover (5.26.0-2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Team upload.
  * Remove inactive Uploaders.
  * Modernize building:
    - add the dh-sequence-kf5 build dependency to use the kf5 addon
      automatically, removing pkg-kde-tools
    - drop all the manually specified addons and buildsystem for dh
  * Drop the removal of executable permissions from autostart desktop files,
    as the issue was fixed upstream some releases ago.
  * Update the build dependencies according to the upstream build system:
    - bump libfwupd-dev to 1.5.0
    - drop libjcat-dev, as it was needed more than a year ago as missing
      dependency of libfwupd-dev
    - limit the architectures of libqt5webview5-dev (as it is optional) only
      where it exists, i.e. amd64 arm64 armhf i386 mips64el mipsel

 -- Pino Toscano <pino@debian.org>  Mon, 17 Oct 2022 07:49:31 +0200

