      libkf5itemviews-dev, libkf5kdelibs4support-dev, libkf5plasma-dev,
      libkf5solid-dev, libkf5textwidgets-dev, libkf5wallet-dev, and
      libkf5widgetsaddons-dev
    - explicitly add gettext
  * Switch from the debhelper build dependency to debhelper-compat
    - remove debian/compat
  * Update install files.
  * Handle conffile removals.
  * Remove the unused DEB_VERSION_UPSTREAM_REVISION variable in rules.
  * Enable all the variations for reprotest in the salsa CI.
  * Enable the fwupd backend:
    - add the libfwupd-dev build dependency
    - add a new plasma-discover-backend-fwupd binary
  * Remove the obsolete debian/not-installed.
  * Remove old dh_makeshlibs override, as it does not apply anymore.
  * Remove debian/gbp.conf, as the packaging repository does not use
    git buildpackage.

